mdl 1;
-- ako/mxcli#1163: two more rows of the version data mxcli vendors from the
-- Model SDK gave a property the version of the property after it, and left
-- that one out — the same generator mistake as AggregateFunction:
--
--   CustomWidgets$WidgetReturnType  Type 9.20.0      (belongs to AssignableTo)
--   Forms$GroupBox                  Caption 8.10.0   (belongs to HeaderMode)
--
-- mendixmodelsdk 4.117.0: WidgetReturnType `type: {}`, `assignableTo:
-- {introduced: "9.20.0"}`; pages.GroupBox `caption: {}`, `headerMode:
-- {introduced: "8.10.0"}`.
--
-- What it changed: a pluggable widget's schema is written with only the keys
-- the project's version declares, by the same data. On 9.0–9.19 every return
-- type in it lost its Type and kept AssignableTo (49 return types across the
-- embedded templates; the slider below has 3). Studio Pro stores
-- {EntityProperty, IsList, Type} on 9.1.1 (208 of 208, the Marketplace's
-- Employee Onboarding app) and 9.4.0 (326 of 326, "Example project workflow
-- extension" 2.0.0), and {AssignableTo, EntityProperty, IsList, Type} on
-- 9.24.3 (57 of 57, Multilevel Dynamic Workflow). The group box row changed
-- nothing mxcli writes: the caption is stored as CaptionTemplate, which the
-- table never keyed, and 8.10 is below every version mxcli supports.
--
-- Measured, exec then `mxcli docker check` on fresh apps, before and after:
-- 10.24.24 and 11.13.0 report 0 errors and store the same key sets. 9.24.30
-- stores Studio Pro 9.24.3's return type key set both times, but its mx check
-- stops with a NullReferenceException in WidgetValue.IsDefault on this page,
-- and on a data grid 2 page. That happens with the build before either
-- ako/mxcli#1163 fix as well, so it is a separate defect. Not run on a
-- 9.0–9.19 platform: those mxbuilds are Mono builds (mx.exe), and no Mono
-- runtime is installed.

create module Probe1163Rt;

create enumeration Probe1163Rt.Country (
  NL 'Netherlands',
  BE 'Belgium'
);

create persistent entity Probe1163Rt.Customer (
  Name: String(100),
  Country: enumeration(Probe1163Rt.Country),
  Score: Integer
);

create page Probe1163Rt.Customer_Edit
(
  params: ( $Customer: Probe1163Rt.Customer ),
  title: 'Customer',
  layout: Atlas_Core.PopupLayout
)
{
  dataview dvCustomer (datasource: $Customer) {
    groupbox gbCustomer (caption: 'Customer', HeaderMode: H3, Collapsible: YesExpanded) {
      textbox txtName (label: 'Name', attribute: Name)
      pluggablewidget 'com.mendix.widget.custom.slider.Slider' sldScore (
        valueAttribute: Score
      )
    }
  }
};
